# dnswatch targets — one FQDN per line, # comments allowed.
# Tip: include (1) every tracked asset from your scope note, (2) known
# CNAME chains' heads, (3) a currently-dead name you suspect may launch
# (it will log A -> "" until the month it goes live, then CHANGES fires).
# A record-type suffix (@MX/@NS/@TXT/@A/@CNAME) watches that one type only —
# handy for apex records (MX/A appearance) the A+CNAME default can't see:
#
# example.com
# www.example.com
# staging.example.com
# quiet-beta.example.com
# example.com@MX
# example.com@NS
